+
+
+// tag::win[]
+Windows installations support multiple DOS paths in `path.data`:
+
+[source,yaml]
+----
+path:
+  data:
+    - "C:\\Elastic\\Elasticsearch_1"
+    - "E:\\Elastic\\Elasticsearch_1"
+    - "F:\\Elastic\\Elasticsearch_3"
+----
+// end::win[]
