+                + NUM_BYTES_OBJECT_REF // children reference
+                + Integer.BYTES // childrenTokenPos
+                + Integer.BYTES // maxChildren
+                + NUM_BYTES_OBJECT_REF // smallestChildReference
+                + sizeOfMap(children, NUM_BYTES_OBJECT_REF) // children,
